{"cod-marker":"SEARCH_LONG_COMPUTING_MINIFIED_JSON_2026","cod-domain":"computing","cod-schema-version":"2026.11","cod-description":"单行压缩JSON，覆盖倒排索引、缓存失效、网络协议与排序算法的二十条可复核记录","cod-records":[{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-001","cod-topic":"inverted index","cod-index-term":"缓存失效","cod-cache-generation":112,"cod-protocol-sequence":7001,"cod-sort-key":"score desc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"term dictionary 同时收纳中文词项与 cache invalidation，posting list 记录词频和位置；段合并读取固定 commit point，删除标记优先于旧记录，同分结果由 stable sort 保持确定顺序。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-002","cod-topic":"cache invalidation","cod-index-term":"generation","cod-cache-generation":113,"cod-protocol-sequence":7002,"cod-sort-key":"generation desc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"写入后广播带 cod-cache-generation 的失效消息，重复投递保持幂等；旧回源请求即使晚到也不能覆盖新代际，singleflight 将同键并发读取折叠为一次。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-003","cod-topic":"network protocol","cod-index-term":"frame boundary","cod-cache-generation":113,"cod-protocol-sequence":7003,"cod-sort-key":"stream id asc,sequence asc","cod-evidence":"长度前缀、payload length 与 checksum 在反序列化前完成校验；sequence 在 stream id 内连续，重复帧去重，丢片触发重组超时，buffer 按高低水位执行背压。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-004","cod-topic":"sorting algorithm","cod-index-term":"stable merge","cod-cache-generation":114,"cod-protocol-sequence":7004,"cod-sort-key":"score desc,document id asc,version desc","cod-evidence":"比较器由分数、文档编号和版本组成全序；稳定归并保留相等键的输入顺序，三路快速排序减少重复分数交换，堆排序仅用于 TopK，外部排序分层合并有序 run。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-005","cod-topic":"inverted index","cod-index-term":"phrase query","cod-cache-generation":114,"cod-protocol-sequence":7005,"cod-sort-key":"position asc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"短语查询先按位置交集过滤，再计算 BM25；高亮只读取有效 position，payload 裁剪不得改变短语成立判断，analyzer 版本变化需要重建受影响 segment。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-006","cod-topic":"cache invalidation","cod-index-term":"negative cache","cod-cache-generation":115,"cod-protocol-sequence":7006,"cod-sort-key":"expires at asc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"负缓存只短暂抑制不存在文档的回源，TTL 设为四十五秒；新文档写入后按 document id 清除负缓存，避免创建后长时间不可见，同时保留 miss 指标用于区分真实缺失与延迟。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-007","cod-topic":"network protocol","cod-index-term":"idempotency","cod-cache-generation":115,"cod-protocol-sequence":7007,"cod-sort-key":"request id asc,attempt asc","cod-evidence":"写请求使用 cod-idempotency-key，服务端保存请求摘要和响应摘要；重试保持同一键，重复请求返回首次结果，总 deadline 覆盖连接、发送、等待和消费阶段。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-008","cod-topic":"sorting algorithm","cod-index-term":"three-way quicksort","cod-cache-generation":116,"cod-protocol-sequence":7008,"cod-sort-key":"score desc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"重复 score 占候选数据三成时，Dutch national flag 划分减少等值交换；递归深度设上限，退化输入切换为堆排序，排序后检查总数守恒与比较器全序。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-009","cod-topic":"inverted index","cod-index-term":"delete marker","cod-cache-generation":116,"cod-protocol-sequence":7009,"cod-sort-key":"visible version desc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"删除标记与 posting 分表存储，查询在打分前过滤不可见版本；段合并应用全部已提交标记，cod-visible-version 防止旧文档在刷新窗口内重新出现。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-010","cod-topic":"cache invalidation","cod-index-term":"tag invalidation","cod-cache-generation":117,"cod-protocol-sequence":7010,"cod-sort-key":"dependency depth asc,tag asc","cod-evidence":"标签失效按依赖图展开，循环依赖被拒绝；批量更新 field boost 时使用代际隔离，消费者落后两个版本即触发对账，避免只依赖一次广播。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-011","cod-topic":"network protocol","cod-index-term":"retry budget","cod-cache-generation":117,"cod-protocol-sequence":7011,"cod-sort-key":"deadline asc,request id asc","cod-evidence":"连接超时、读取超时和总 deadline 分别计量；可重试错误最多尝试两次，退避加入 jitter，参数错误与权限错误不重试，指标按连接、发送、等待和消费拆分。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-012","cod-topic":"sorting algorithm","cod-index-term":"external merge","cod-cache-generation":118,"cod-protocol-sequence":7012,"cod-sort-key":"run id asc,record key asc","cod-evidence":"外部排序生成八个有序 run，超过单次归并上限时分层合并；每次只保留获胜 run 的当前记录，磁盘读写次数与 run 数量纳入预算，最终游标保存完整 sort key。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-013","cod-topic":"inverted index","cod-index-term":"term frequency","cod-cache-generation":118,"cod-protocol-sequence":7013,"cod-sort-key":"term frequency desc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"词频只在当前可见段内累计，重复文档不重复计数；field length 参与 BM25 归一化，posting 位置必须落在字段边界内，跳表加速多个倒排链表的交集。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-014","cod-topic":"cache invalidation","cod-index-term":"stampede","cod-cache-generation":119,"cod-protocol-sequence":7014,"cod-sort-key":"arrival time asc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"热点键失效后请求合并器只允许一次回源，其余请求共享结果并受 deadline 约束；回源写入缓存前比较 generation，旧结果自动丢弃，防止延迟双删竞态。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-015","cod-topic":"network protocol","cod-index-term":"fragment reassembly","cod-cache-generation":119,"cod-protocol-sequence":7015,"cod-sort-key":"stream id asc,sequence asc","cod-evidence":"分片按 sequence 排序并检测空洞，首片确定总长度，末片检查结束标记；超时后释放不完整 buffer，重复分片不增加计数，应用层不交付半条消息。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-016","cod-topic":"sorting algorithm","cod-index-term":"radix sort","cod-cache-generation":120,"cod-protocol-sequence":7016,"cod-sort-key":"encoded key asc,document id asc","cod-evidence":"基数排序只用于可逆编码的定长键，编码必须保持业务顺序；负数、前缀长度和尾随零需要专门处理，UTF-8 字节不能直接替代中文业务排序规则。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-017","cod-topic":"inverted index","cod-index-term":"segment visibility","cod-cache-generation":120,"cod-protocol-sequence":7017,"cod-sort-key":"commit point asc,segment id asc","cod-evidence":"新 segment 提交前不可见，commit point 单调推进；合并中的段保持只读，查询通过同一快照读取多个段，刷新失败时继续使用上一个完整提交点。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-018","cod-topic":"cache invalidation","cod-index-term":"preload","cod-cache-generation":121,"cod-protocol-sequence":7018,"cod-sort-key":"heat desc,expires at asc","cod-evidence":"预热按近期访问热度选择键，容量到达高水位停止加载；低优先级预载可被失效消息取消，回填结果必须携带来源版本，避免预热流量挤占在线请求。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-019","cod-topic":"network protocol","cod-index-term":"flow control","cod-cache-generation":121,"cod-protocol-sequence":7019,"cod-sort-key":"window update asc,sequence asc","cod-evidence":"滑动窗口限制未确认字节数，接收方按消费能力发送 window update；高水位暂停读取，低水位恢复，零窗口探测防止双方等待，连接复用不重置 stream 状态。"},{"cod-document-id":"computing-json-020","cod-topic":"sorting algorithm","cod-index-term":"page cursor","cod-cache-generation":122,"cod-protocol-sequence":7020,"cod-sort-key":"score desc,document id asc,version desc","cod-evidence":"深分页游标保存最后一条完整排序键，不使用易变 offset；新写入可能改变后续页但不重复已读键，排序后校验键单调、总数守恒、去重完成，并与缓存和协议字段联合断言。"}],"cod-expected-fields":["cod-document-id","cod-topic","cod-index-term","cod-cache-generation","cod-protocol-sequence","cod-sort-key","cod-evidence"],"cod-final-state":"二十条记录均可由同一模板解析，四个主题交叉出现且没有尾随换行"}